  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Details about the topic:\n\nUpdates for vote kicking should be added.\n\nWhen vote kicking someone a menu should pop up giving you 5 options:\n\n- Harassment towards other players\n\n- Use of bad avatar behavior.\n\n- Away of Keyboard(AFK)\n\n- Cheating/Hacking\n\n- Other\n\nWhen someone start a vote kick, the player that started the vote kick should pop up in the message with the reason the user select, as an example:\n\n \"BubbleCakes as started a vote kicked against WalkingFish. Reason: \"Cheating/Hacking\".\n\nor\n\n\"BubbleCakes as started a vote kicked against WalkingFish. Reason: \"Other(Explanation)\".\n\nI'm sure Vrchat is a social game, therefore should be a explanation of the visible user of who started the vote kick, many players in the game abuse the vote kick system and the rest in the lobby most of the time accept/Agree these vote not knowing why and the reason of them or simply they just agree. Vote kicking users for no reason shouldn't not be a thing, other users simply vote kick others because they dislike them, I'm sure abusing these its not friendly at all.",
